  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "这是您的休息间  (This Is Your Dressing Room)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "kaiwen": "凯文",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Special guest Li Mingji arrives backstage, and Chun Yuqiao spots Bu Xiaogu on the security monitor walking beside the demanding star. Listen to the Mandarin dialogue first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "等会儿，切回上一个画面。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "布小谷在那儿干吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我不是说了吗，不要让她接近那个麻烦人物。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你是说她是菜鸟吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "找人替代布小谷，今天晚上全程盯住李铭基。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "李铭基先生，这是您的休息间。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "里面已经准备好了一些食品和饮品。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您要是有任何需求，尽管喊我就行。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我是制作部门负责接待您的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "李先生好像很满意小谷的安排。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "等会儿，切回上一个画面。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hold on, switch back to the previous camera feed.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "布小谷在那儿干吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What is Bu Xiaogu doing over there?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我不是说了吗，不要让她接近那个麻烦人物。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Did I not say not to let her near that difficult guest?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你是说她是菜鸟吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are you calling her a rookie?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "找人替代布小谷，今天晚上全程盯住李铭基。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Find someone to replace Bu Xiaogu and watch over Li Mingji all evening.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "李铭基先生，这是您的休息间。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Li Mingji, this is your dressing room.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "里面已经准备好了一些食品和饮品。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Some food and drinks have already been prepared inside.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您要是有任何需求，尽管喊我就行。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If you need anything at all, just call for me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我是制作部门负责接待您的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am from the production department in charge of hosting you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "李先生好像很满意小谷的安排。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Li seems quite pleased with Xiaogu's arrangements.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "等会儿，切回上一个画面。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "布小谷在那儿干吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我不是说了吗，不要让她接近那个麻烦人物。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你是说她是菜鸟吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "找人替代布小谷，今天晚上全程盯住李铭基。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "李铭基先生，这是您的休息间。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "里面已经准备好了一些食品和饮品。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您要是有任何需求，尽管喊我就行。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我是制作部门负责接待您的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "李先生好像很满意小谷的安排。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Xiaogu's warm courtesy wins Li Mingji over right as Yuqiao tries to keep rookies out of harm's way. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "回头见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
